{"chapter": 141, "provider": "SUCCESS", "schema": [], "delta": {"new_relationships": [{"ozne": "Castle Guard", "iliski": "lideri", "nesne": "Tessai", "kanit": "The Castle Guard was led by a morose giant of a man named Tessai, who was one of Gunlaug’s most trusted lieutenants and perhaps the oldest Sleeper on the Forgotten Shore — he was just two years short of thirty.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Tessai", "iliski": "rutbesi", "nesne": "Sleeper", "kanit": "The Castle Guard was led by a morose giant of a man named Tessai, who was one of Gunlaug’s most trusted lieutenants and perhaps the oldest Sleeper on the Forgotten Shore — he was just two years short of thirty.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Hunters", "iliski": "lideri", "nesne": "Gemma", "kanit": "Both Hunters and Pathfinders were led by a charismatic man called Gemma.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Pathfinders", "iliski": "lideri", "nesne": "Gemma", "kanit": "Both Hunters and Pathfinders were led by a charismatic man called Gemma.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Host", "iliski": "lideri", "nesne": "Gunlaug", "kanit": "Together, these three groups — Guards, Hunters, and Pathfinders — formed Gunlaug’s army, which was simply known as the Host.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}], "new_aliases": [{"asil": "Gunlaug", "ad": "Bright Lord", "tur": "unvani", "kanit": "Better life meant winning Gunlaug’s favor, while going too far meant losing it and being banished into the cold darkness of the outer settlement. Both fear and hope were created and firmly grasped by the Bright Lord.", "durum_bilgisi": "strongly_implied"}], "relationship_updates": [], "state_changes": [], "identity_revelations": [], "contradictions": [], "new_entities": [], "review_items": []}, "counters": {"already_known_proposals": 0, "deterministic_same_chapter_duplicates": 0, "same_chapter_existing_proposals": 0, "unsupported_state_keys": 0, "new_entity_candidates": 0, "direction_errors": 0, "high_impact_evidence_failures": 0, "unsupported_review_items": 0}}
