{"chapter": 322, "provider": "SUCCESS", "schema": [], "delta": {"new_relationships": [{"ozne": "Seishan", "iliski": "anisi", "nesne": "Sunlight Shard", "kanit": "Somewhere along the way, he noticed Seishan herself. The beautiful woman was fighting with darkly fascinating grace. The Sunlight Shard rose and fell, guided by her slender hand.", "durum_bilgisi": "strongly_implied", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}, {"ozne": "Sunlight Shard", "iliski": "turu", "nesne": "Memory", "kanit": "The Sunlight Shard rose and fell, guided by her slender hand. The amount of power delivered by each strike, however, was nothing short of terrifying. Every time the war hammer struck, a Nightmare Creature was broken apart, with bits of chitin, bone, and streams of blood flying into the air. It was still not enough, though. After another blow, a menacing figure of a carapace scavenger suddenly grasped the Memory in its powerful pincer and tore it away from Seishan’s hand.", "durum_bilgisi": "confirmed", "gecerli_baslangic": null, "gecerli_bitis": null}], "new_aliases": [], "relationship_updates": [], "state_changes": [], "identity_revelations": [], "contradictions": [], "new_entities": [], "review_items": []}, "counters": {"already_known_proposals": 0, "deterministic_same_chapter_duplicates": 0, "same_chapter_existing_proposals": 0, "unsupported_state_keys": 0, "new_entity_candidates": 0, "direction_errors": 0, "high_impact_evidence_failures": 0, "unsupported_review_items": 0}}
